
# Vodafone CX Research Multi-Agent System

## Overview

This project demonstrates a Multi-Agent Customer Experience (CX) Research Assistant built using Google's Agent Development Kit (ADK).

The system analyzes customer experience data from multiple sources such as:

* Customer complaints
* Call center transcripts
* Customer feedback and NPS data
* Telecom industry research

The solution uses a Master Orchestrator Agent to route requests to specialized agents and a Critic Agent to validate findings and generate an executive summary.

---

## Architecture

```text
                    User Request
                          |
                          v

                Master Orchestrator Agent
                          |
        ----------------------------------------
        |                  |                   |
        v                  v                   v

Customer Service    Call Center       Generic Research
      Agent            Agent               Agent

        ----------------------------------------
                          |
                          v

                    Critic Agent
          (Validation & Synthesis Layer)

                          |
                          v

                  Executive Summary
```

### Agents

#### Master Orchestrator Agent

Responsible for:

* Understanding the user request
* Selecting the appropriate specialist agent(s)
* Delegating tasks
* Forwarding findings to the Critic Agent

#### Customer Service Agent

Analyzes:

* Customer complaints
* Customer feedback
* NPS responses
* Churn indicators
* Customer sentiment

#### Call Center Agent

Analyzes:

* Call transcripts
* Escalation patterns
* Resolution effectiveness
* Customer frustration indicators
* Operational issues

#### Generic Research Agent

Performs:

* Telecom industry research
* Competitor benchmarking
* Market intelligence gathering
* CX best-practice analysis

#### Critic Agent

Responsible for:

* Validating findings
* Detecting unsupported claims
* Resolving conflicting conclusions
* Assigning confidence scores
* Producing the final executive summary

---

## Prerequisites

* Python 3.10+
* Google ADK
* Gemini API Key

---

## Setup Instructions

### Create Virtual Environment

```bash
python -m venv vois_research_agent_env
```

### Activate Virtual Environment

Linux / macOS:

```bash
source vois_research_agent_env/bin/activate
```

Windows:

```bash
vois_research_agent_env\Scripts\activate
```

### Install Dependencies


pip install -r requirements.txt



## Configure Gemini API Key

If you don't already have an API key, create one using Google AI Studio:

https://aistudio.google.com/apikey

Create a `.env` file in the project root directory:

```env
GOOGLE_API_KEY=YOUR_API_KEY_HERE
```

